{"last_link_id": 79, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [1586.3812255859375, 1323.5838623046875], "pos": [5087.38818359375, 272.15850830078125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 60, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 49, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [345.1251220703125, 484.70001220703125], "pos": [4241.6298828125, 308.55181884765625], "widgets_values": ["作为资深家居摄影师与数字化织物打样专家，我已将您的【现代新中式风格】需求与【9:16 商业实拍视觉排版逻辑】完美融合。\n\n为了确保 AI（如 Midjourney V6）能精准生成这种带有极强“反AI人工感”、具备《安邸AD》杂志级光影和工业级打样细节的图像，我为您编写了结构化的超高精度英文 Prompt。\n\n您可以直接复制以下提示词生成图像：\n\n### 📸 工业级全案打样 Prompt (直接复制使用)\n\n> **Prompt:**\n> An editorial presentation board divided into three horizontal sections (Top 40%, Middle 25%, Bottom 35%), Architectural Digest magazine style, Neo-Chinese Zen aesthetic, off-white background with natural diffuse reflection, photorealistic, 8k raw photo, shot on Fujifilm GFX 100S. **Top Section:** A lifestyle shot of a living room. Natural window light diffused through soft paper. A large 1.6x2.3m high-density crystal velvet rug on the floor, featuring a central Zaojing (caisson) totem in Dai Green, Moon White, and Shadow Gray. A young Chinese female model in cotton-linen loungewear sits naturally on the rug, creating realistic fabric indentations and creases. The gold tracing on the rug has micro-breaks, ink buildup, and metallic shimmer. Minimalist Chinese text top left: \"彩色打样实拍参考\". **Middle Section:** Two macro close-up shots. Left: macro view of crystal velvet showing pile directionality and a finger-swiped look with light/dark variations, Dai Green ink wash edges with paper-bleed feathering. Right: macro view of anti-slip backing with irregular plastic dots showing slight sheen, and a side profile showing the multi-layer thickness of the mat. Chinese text: \"4K高精打印纹理特写\". **Bottom Section:** Production digital engineering diagram. A bitmap stream look with subtle textile halftone dots. Shows a 0.4x1.2m runner mat with a continuous border design. Cutting bed interface with bleed margin lines. Physical 3D color swatches in Dai Green, Moon White, and Shadow Gray with slight drop shadows and HEX/CMYK parameters. Chinese text: \"彩色打样样板与生产执行标准\" and \"电脑裁床：160x230cm\". Cinematic lighting, inconsistent fabric pile, natural shadows, textile weave visible, non-AI synthetic texture. --ar 9:16 --style raw --v 6.0\n\n---\n\n### 💡 专家级视觉拆解与参数说明（为什么这样写能出神图）：\n\n1. **色彩与图腾的真实感 (Neo-Chinese Zen & Zaojing)**\n   * **黛绿+月白+灰影**：这组色彩在 AI 中容易显得过于饱和。提示词中通过 `Natural window light diffused through soft paper`（柔光纸掩膜窗光）压制了色彩溢出，让黛绿呈现出高级的灰度，月白带有真实的漫反射。\n   * **藻井图腾 (Zaojing totem)**：结合 `micro-breaks, ink buildup, and metallic shimmer`（微观断续、油墨堆积、金属反光），彻底打破 AI 生成矢量图案的扁平感，还原丝网印刷金粉的物理厚度。\n\n2. **面料微观物理特性的重构 (Crystal Velvet)**\n   * **倒顺毛与压痕**：通过 `model sits naturally... creating realistic fabric indentations` 强制 AI 计算面料的物理承重形变；`pile directionality and a finger-swiped look` 完美模拟了高密度水晶绒被手抚摸过后的深浅色差（这是区分真假照片的核心细节）。\n   * **水墨毛刺感**：`paper-bleed feathering`（纸张渗透感的毛刺）确保了新中式水墨晕染边缘不会是死板的渐变，而是带有纤维毛细管效应的真实渗色。\n\n3. **数字化生产底图的专业度 (Engineering Diagram)**\n   * **网点与出血位**：底部区域引入 `bitmap stream look with subtle textile halftone dots`（带有织物网点纹理的位图流）和 `bleed margin lines`（出血位），直接把视觉拉到工厂后端的裁床界面。\n   * **色卡投影**：`Physical 3D color swatches... with slight drop shadows` 让色块不再是悬浮的色块，而是像实物样板一样贴在图纸上。\n\n**⚠️ 摄影师实操建议：**\n如果您使用的是 Midjourney V6，它对中文文字的生成能力已有提升，但可能偶尔会出现错别字。如果您对排版文字有极高的商业交付要求，建议在出图后，将图片导入 Photoshop，用方正清刻本悦宋或思源黑体将文字重新覆盖一遍，质感将直接达到顶尖家居品牌的全案提案标准。"], "input